---

# Motion

Allowed:

Smooth countdown.

Subtle transition to GO.

Progress updates.

Button press feedback.

Not allowed:

Flashing countdown.

Pulse animation.

Bounce.

Glow.

Confetti.

---

# Accessibility

The countdown must remain readable:

In bright sunlight.

With increased Dynamic Type.

At several meters.

Touch targets:

Minimum 44 pt.

Preferred 48 pt.

---

# Error Handling

If timing is interrupted:

Explain immediately.

Restore the remaining time when possible.

Never silently restart the timer.

---

# Offline Behaviour

The Rest Screen remains fully functional offline.

Countdowns never depend on network connectivity.

---

