---

# Success Criteria

The athlete should never ask:

"How long is left?"

"What comes next?"

"What weight do I use?"

The Rest Screen has already answered those questions.

---

# Final Principle

Recovery is part of training.

The Rest Screen prepares the next performance.

Not the next interaction.